# 7. Recommendation Flow

Current project contains multiple recommendation paths.

Replace with one single recommendation pipeline.

Lead Assessment

↓

Fit Score

↓

Engagement Score

↓

Overall Score

↓

Recommendation

↓

Return Response

Recommendation must always use the latest calculated scores.

Never calculate recommendation independently.

