# 12. Final Goal

The AI Service should become a completely stateless computation engine.

Backend owns:

- Database
- State
- Event Processing

AI Service owns:

- Feature Engineering
- Scoring
- Recommendation
- AI Summarization

This separation ensures maintainability, scalability, and future replacement of rule-based scoring with ML models without changing the backend architecture.